    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 15th level, a battle butler and his master (or masters) becomes immune to mind-affecting effects while his service meter is between 10 and 5 (at 4 or below the immunity does not function). The battle butler and his master may decide on a case by case basis, as a free action, to allow certain effects through.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/battle-butler#toc44\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
